    <!-- This chapter is deliberately unnumbered: its heading, its section  -->
    <!-- headings, and its table-of-contents entries show bare titles.      -->
    <!-- The numbers are hidden by assets/unnumbered-chapter.css, wired in  -->
    <!-- through html.css.extra in xsl/custom-html.xsl.                     -->
    <chapter xml:id="ch-problems">
      <title>Assignments and Review Problems</title>
      <introduction>
        <p>
          The nine assignments and the review problem sets, in one place.
          You can check your work by entering your answers in the provided
          boxes: type an answer, press <q>Check Me</q>, and check as often
          as you like. Each box is graded on its own, so a box you get
          right earns its credit even when another box in the same problem
          is wrong. This lets you verify your final answers before
          submitting the complete solution to be graded by the grader.
        </p>
        <p>
          Complete worked solutions will appear beneath each problem after
          the due date of its assignment; solutions for the review sets are
          posted the same way.
        </p>
      </introduction>
